20:40.978 --> 20:45.745
My name is Charlie
and my maid says I'm a sex addict.

20:46.317 --> 20:47.978
Hi, Charlie.

20:57.728 --> 21:00.925
Hi. I'm Alan...

21:02.132 --> 21:03.895
