21:07.104 --> 21:09.072
And I'm a sex addict.

21:09.239 --> 21:10.729
Hi, Alan.

21:10.908 --> 21:13.069
It's priced to move.

21:18.182 --> 21:20.514
Hi, my name is Pam...

21:20.684 --> 21:22.151
